@page "/layout-chrome"

<PageTitle>Layout, chrome & icons — FactoryAspects Showcase</PageTitle>

<h1>Layout, chrome &amp; icons</h1>

<FaCard CssClass="fa-mb-4">
    <p>
        This whole app is already the live demo of the layout shells — <code>Layout/MainLayout.razor</code>
        wraps every page in <code>&lt;SidebarShell&gt;</code>, with <code>Layout/NavMenu.razor</code>
        as its <code>Sidebar</code> content. The header's theme switcher, the sidebar's
        collapse toggle, and this page's palette switcher below are all the same
        components a real consumer wires up via <code>StandardShell</code>/<code>SidebarShell</code> —
        see <a href="https://github.com/bencalvin/FactoryAspects/blob/dev/Blazor/docs/layout-shells.md" target="_blank">Blazor/docs/layout-shells.md</a>.
    </p>
</FaCard>

<h2>ThemeSwitcher</h2>
<p>Already baked into <code>AppHeader</code> (top right) — also droppable standalone:</p>
<ThemeSwitcher />

<h2 class="fa-mt-5">PaletteSwitcher</h2>
<p>Also already in this page's sidebar (top) — same component, dropped in again here:</p>
<PaletteSwitcher />

<h2 class="fa-mt-5">FaIcon</h2>
<p>The full hand-drawn set — <code>@_iconNames.Count</code> icons, no icon font/external dependency.</p>
<div class="fa-icon-grid">
    @foreach (var name in _iconNames)
    {
        <div class="fa-icon-grid-item">
            <FaIcon Name="name" Color="FaIconColor.Black" Size="24" Title="@name.ToString()" />
            <span>@name</span>
        </div>
    }
</div>

<style>
    .fa-icon-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(110px, 1fr));
        gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .fa-icon-grid-item {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.35rem;
        padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;
        border: var(--fa-border-width) solid var(--fa-border);
        border-radius: var(--fa-radius-md);
        background: var(--fa-surface);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--fa-text-muted);
    }
</style>

@code {
    private readonly List<FaIconName> _iconNames = Enum.GetValues<FaIconName>().ToList();
}
